  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math> be such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi></math> is equal to</p><p>Now given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>iii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Now subtracting equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mi>iii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>We get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math>, now putting&nbsp; in equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>We get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
